# SHARA Client

SHARA Client — client-side Fabric mod scaffold for Minecraft 1.21.4.

This repository contains an in-development client mod with a modular architecture, ClickGUI, HUD system and theme/font/animation managers. The project is work-in-progress and is being implemented in stages; each stage is committed to the repository.

Quick start
1. Install JDK 21 (recommended) or JDK 17.
2. Clone:
   git clone https://github.com/bore1c/shara-client.git
3. Build:
   ./gradlew build
4. Run dev client (Loom):
   ./gradlew runClient

Development notes
- The mod uses Fabric Loader and Fabric API for Minecraft 1.21.4. Check build.gradle.kts for versions.
- Configs are saved under `config/shara-client/`.
- Profiles are stored under `config/shara-client/profiles/`.

Security & policy
- This project intentionally avoids implementing any automated PvP features, anti-cheat bypasses, or server-exploiting behaviors. Visual modules use only client-visible data.

